				<u>OC</u>
				1431
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ δεδογμένα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					3.76
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεδόχθαι τῇ βουλῇ καὶ τῷ δήμῳ</span>”
