					Th.
					1.76
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δοκοῦντες εἶναί τι</span>
			<i>men who are held</i> to be something, <i>men of repute,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Grg.</u>
				472a
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ δοκεῖν τινὲς εἶναι . .
