				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					21.213
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ φρονεῖν ἐδόκει τις εἶναι περιττός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Arist.</u>
					1
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ δοκοῦντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Heraclit.
					28
