					60
				</span></i>
			. (The two senses of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δοκέω</span>
			are sts. contrasted, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἀεὶ δοκοῦντα . .
				τῷ δοκοῦντι εἶναι ἀληθῆ</span> that which
			<i>seems</i> true is true <i>to him who thinks</i> it, <i><span class="en">
